msgstr "ፋይሎችን ሳይሰርዙ የገባ ተጠቃሚን ይሰርዙ?"

#: src/ui/UserDetailsPage.qml:114
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:window"
msgid "Delete Logged-In User?"
msgstr "የገባ ተጠቃሚ ይሰረዝ?"

#: src/ui/UserDetailsPage.qml:116
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:usagetip"
msgid ""
"%1 is currently logged in, so their files cannot be deleted. Delete just the "
"account instead?<nl/><nl/>This will make %1 unable to log in again, and they "
"may experience strange behaviors until they log out."
msgstr ""
"%1 በአሁኑ ጊዜ ገብቷል፣ ስለዚህ ፋይሎቻቸው ሊሰረዙ አይችሉም። በምትኩ መለያውን ብቻ ይሰርዙ?<nl/><nl/>ይህ %1 "
"እንደገና መግባት እንዳይችል ያደርጋቸዋል፣ እና እስኪወጡ ድረስ እንግዳ ባህሪያት ሊያጋጥሟቸው ይችላሉ።"

#: src/ui/UserDetailsPage.qml:117
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:usagetip"
msgid ""
"%1 is currently logged in. Deleting the account will make them unable to log "
"in again, and they may experience strange behaviors until they log out."
msgstr ""
"%1 በአሁኑ ሰዓት ገብቷል። መለያውን መሰረዝ ዳግመኛ እንዳይገባ ያደርገዋል፤ እንዲሁም ከስርዓቱ እስኪወጣ ድረስ "
"ያልተለመዱ ነገሮች ሊያጋጥሙት ይችላሉ።"

#: src/ui/UserDetailsPage.qml:124
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action: button"
msgid "Delete %1"
msgstr "ሰርዝ %1"

#: src/ui/UserDetailsPage.qml:143
#, kde-format
msgid "Change avatar"
msgstr "ምስል ቀይር"

#: src/ui/UserDetailsPage.qml:193
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label:tooltip"
msgid ""
"Cannot change your own username while logged in; log out and then log in as "
"another user to change this account’s username."
msgstr ""
"ሲገቡ የራስዎን የተጠቃሚ ስም መቀየር አይቻልም፤ ውጣና ከዚያ የዚህን መለያ የተጠቃሚ ስም ለመቀየር እንደ ሌላ ተጠቃሚ "
"ግባ።"

#: src/ui/UserDetailsPage.qml:194
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label:tooltip"
msgid ""
"Cannot change the username of a logged-in user; wait until this user logs "
"out first."
msgstr "የገባ ተጠቃሚን የተጠቃሚ ስም መቀየር አይቻልም፤ ይህ ተጠቃሚ መጀመሪያ እስኪወጣ ድረስ ይጠብቁ።"

#: src/ui/UserDetailsPage.qml:222
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Cannot change the account type to Standard unless there is at least one "
"other Administrator account on the system. Without one, authentication would "
"become impossible or require the insecure use of the root password."
msgstr ""
"በስርዓቱ ላይ ቢያንስ አንድ ሌላ የአስተዳዳሪ መለያ ከሌለ በስተቀር የመለያውን አይነት ወደ መደበኛ መለወጥ አይቻልም። "
"ያለሱ፣ ማረጋገጫ የማይቻል ይሆናል ወይም ደህንነቱ ያልተጠበቀ የስር ይለፍ ቃል መጠቀምን ይጠይቃል።"

#: src/ui/UserDetailsPage.qml:230
#, kde-format
msgid "Email address:"
msgstr "የኢሜይል አድራሻ፦"

#: src/ui/UserDetailsPage.qml:262
#, kde-format
msgid "Delete files"
msgstr "ፋይሎችን ሰርዝ"

#: src/ui/UserDetailsPage.qml:269
#, kde-format
msgid "Keep files"
msgstr "ፋይሎችን ያስቀምጡ"

#: src/ui/UserDetailsPage.qml:276
#, kde-format
msgid "Delete User…"
msgstr "ተጠቃሚን ሰርዝ…"

#: src/ui/UserDetailsPage.qml:282
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label:tooltip"
msgid ""
"Cannot delete yourself! Log out and then log in as another user to delete "
"this user account."
msgstr "እራስዎን መሰረዝ አይችሉም! ይህንን የተጠቃሚ መለያ ለመሰረዝ ይውጡ እና ከዚያ እንደ ሌላ ተጠቃሚ ይግቡ።"

#: src/ui/UserDetailsPage.qml:294
#, kde-format
msgid "Configure Fingerprint Authentication…"
msgstr "የጣት አሻራ ማረጋገጫን ያዋቅሩ…"

#: src/ui/UserDetailsPage.qml:326
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Fingerprints can be used in place of a password when unlocking the screen "
"and providing administrator permissions to applications and command-line "
"programs that request them.<nl/><nl/>Logging into the system with your "
"fingerprint is not yet supported."
msgstr ""
"ማያ ገጹን ሲከፍቱ እና ለመተግበሪያዎች እና ለትእዛዝ መስመር ፕሮግራሞች የአስተዳዳሪ ፈቃዶችን ሲሰጡ የይለፍ ቃል ምትክ "
"የጣት አሻራዎች ጥቅም ላይ ሊውሉ ይችላሉ።<nl/><nl/>በጣት አሻራዎ ወደ ስርዓቱ መግባት እስካሁን አይደገፍም።"

